You passed Koley...

304
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:06,000
Yalla saet xweş.
 
Yalla bless you.

305
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:07,000
Ev jî draktorê Koleyê ye.
 
This is also Koley's tractor.

306
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:08,000
