May God put the homeland in the heart.

321
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:02,000
Wele gundekî pirr xweş e.
 
By God a very nice village.

322
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:04,000
Fadle wa ez vî gundina jî dibînim.
 
Fadil, look I see this village too.

323
