337
00:30:55,000 --> 00:30:59,000
Welle ferq bû lê mezin e maşallah.
 
Well, there was a difference, but it is big, Mashallah.

338
00:30:59,000 --> 00:31:09,000
Ava mekteb e, teben vir jî mekteb dikin.
 
This is the school, naturally they use this place as a
school too.

339
