Oh, how nice the smell of manure is.

428
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:40,000
Gundo... paşxay.
 
The village... is beautiful.

429
00:40:40,000 --> 00:40:43,000
Awa ro rast bim, darên ke, darên ba'îva.
 
To be honest, old trees, almond trees.

430
00:40:43,000 --> 00:40:46,000
Maşallah cema'et, ba'îv tê de tijî ye.
 
Mashallah folks, it is full of almonds.

431
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:51,000
Vê, hê, hê, maşallah, maşallah, Xwedê bereketê têke.
 
Look, hey, hey, Mashallah, Mashallah, may God put blessing
in it.

432
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:54,000
Ho ho ho.
 
Ho ho ho.

433
00:40:54,000 --> 00:40:57,000
Em hatine cem cîranê we, yê ba'îva diçine.
 
We came to your neighbor, who is picking almonds.

434
00:40:57,000 --> 00:41:00,000
Hê, hê.
 
Hey, hey.

435
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:01,000
Rehet î şêre?
 
Are you well, lion?

436
00:41:01,000 --> 00:41:03,000
Welah elhemdulilah şikir.
 
By God, praise be to God, thanks.

437
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:06,000
Ya, ehlen wa sehlen. Xwedê quwetê bide, Xwedê bereketê têxe.
 
Yes, welcome. May God give strength, may God put blessing in
it.

438
00:41:06,000 --> 00:41:08,000
Sa'eta we xweş be, sa'eta we xweş be.
 
Health to you, health to you.

439
00:41:08,000 --> 00:41:09,000
Tu ji Ba'dîno yî?
 
Are you from Badina?

440
00:41:09,000 --> 00:41:10,000
Ser serî me.
 
You are welcome [On our head].

441
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:12,000
Sa'eta we xweş.
 
Health to you.

442
00:41:12,000 --> 00:41:13,000
Mihemed Îbiş nas dikî?
 
Do you know Mihemed Ibish?

443
00:41:13,000 --> 00:41:15,000
Mihemed Îbiş? Welahî nizan...
 
Mihemed Ibish? By God, I don't know...

444
00:41:15,000 --> 00:41:18,000
Tayib me'rûf e, ya Mihemed Hemze heye.
 
Okay, he is well known, oh, Mihemed Hamze is there.

445
00:41:18,000 --> 00:41:21,000
Xudanê mekbezê Riyad hebû.
 
There was the owner of the Riyad bakery.

446
00:41:21,000 --> 00:41:24,000
Yekî wekî me tenikî dirêj, me berê daxwend.
 
One like us, thin and tall, we invited him before.

447
00:41:24,000 --> 00:41:26,000
Belkî noka nal bibe.
 
Maybe now he has become a horseshoe [joke].

448
00:41:26,000 --> 00:41:27,000
Maşallah gund mezin e.
 
Mashallah the village is big.

449
00:41:27,000 --> 00:41:32,000
Ya ehlen wa sehlen ji cema'eta gundê me yê Ba'dîna tev da.
 
Yes, welcome to the community of our village of Badina, all
of them.

450
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:40,000
Ela kulin, we di mentiqê da, we... we ûla bir, ûla... we
derec ûla li Newrozê bir.
 
Anyway, in the region, he... he took the first, the first...
he took the first degree at Newroz.

451
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:41,000
Sa'et xweş Xolo.
 
Good health, Uncle.

452
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:45,000
Li Newrozê we derec ûla bir. Salê çûyî we bir, we îsal jî
temam kir.
 
At Newroz you took the first degree. Last year you took it,
and this year you completed it.

453
00:41:45,000 --> 00:41:48,000
Me temam kir, me Kurdistan ava kir.
 
We completed it, we built Kurdistan.

454
00:41:48,000 --> 00:41:49,000
Bijî ji we ra.
 
Long live to you.

455
00:41:49,000 --> 00:41:50,000
Sa'eta te jî xweş Xolo.
 
Health to you too, Uncle.

456
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,000
Ehlen wa sehlen.
 
Welcome.

457
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:53,000
Ser serî.
 
You are welcome.

458
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:55,000
Sa'b be. Ha wile.
 
Be healthy. Yes, by God.

459
00:41:55,000 --> 00:42:00,000
Kerem ke Cîran Xelîl, Ebû Şiyar, tu çûyî rehet î...
 
Please Neighbor Xelil, Abu Shiyar, you went, are you
comfortable...

460
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Na te got da tiştekî ji bîr kiribim. Te got vira bin, malê
we ba'îvê me ne ev in.
 
No, you said lest I forgot something. You said be here, our
property, aren't these our almonds.

461
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:10,000
Xwedê rehetiyê bide keçkê te û jinka te de, Xwedê we giya
bêle.
 
May God give comfort to your daughter and your wife, may God
keep you all.

462
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:14,000
Îm bixelametî (bi selametî), me çêkir ha, me şên kir.
 
We safely, look we made it, we cultivated it.

463
00:42:14,000 --> 00:42:19,000
Em li vir man, bes me şên kir yanî. Sa'ê me ta benda, bes me
şên kir.
 
We stayed here, but we cultivated it, that is. Our time
[unclear], but we cultivated it.

464
00:42:19,000 --> 00:42:20,000
Na, sa'et xweş.
 
No, good health.

465
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:26,000
İnşallah em bernadin. Heta... dil û pî... Heta em sax in, em
neh'c bernadin.
 
God willing we won't give up. Until... heart and lung... As
long as we are alive, we won't give up the path.

466
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:29,000
Neh'cê bab û bapîra em bernadin.
 
We won't give up the path of our fathers and grandfathers.

467
00:42:29,000 --> 00:42:31,000
İnşallah, inşallah, Xwedê heye.
 
God willing, God willing, God exists.

468
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:39,000
Bi me ra bin heta em darin cem hevalê me jêr jî, çû ba'îva
dikişînin, bi me ra bin.
 
Stay with us until we go to our friends down there too, who
are picking almonds, stay with us.

469
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:47,000
Na, em şêr in şêr. Her yekî Kurd Axayê...
 
No, we are lions, lions. Every Kurd is an Agha...

470
00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:57,000
Top, teyyare, şobana, dize, çi dixwaze me gidi, me berxwedan
û em narevin.
 
Cannon, airplane, ammo, tank, whatever it wants against us,
we resisted and we don't run away.

471
00:42:57,000 --> 00:43:00,000
Adre tora min ê ho vo, ad (ez) gelê hawa...
 
[Unclear] I with you...

472
00:43:00,000 --> 00:43:02,000
Em wa bernadin, nehar û ebbet.
 
We won't give up on you, never and forever.

473
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:04,000
Sa'et xweş Xolo, sa'et xweş.
 
Good health Uncle, good health.

474
00:43:04,000 --> 00:43:09,000
Temam? Ke her yekî wekî me bikra, sa de gundê me da ba tişto
çênebî.
 
Okay? If everyone did like us, then nothing [bad] would
happen in our village.

475
00:43:09,000 --> 00:43:12,000
E bota nade reş meşo da belkî...
 
[Unclear] maybe...

476
00:43:12,000 --> 00:43:13,000
Xwedê 'emrê kî dirêj bide te de.
 
May God give you a long life.

477
00:43:13,000 --> 00:43:14,000
Bide te de jî. Sa'et xweş.
 
Give it to you too. Good health.

478
00:43:14,000 --> 00:43:21,000
Erê havalo, teb'en viderê em hatin malê cîranê we jî, yê
ba'îva dikişînin.
 
Yes friends, naturally here we came to the house of your
neighbor too, who are picking almonds.

479
00:43:21,000 --> 00:43:24,000
Xwedê bereketê têke, quwet be, quwet be.
 
May God put blessing in it, be strong, be strong.

480
00:43:24,000 --> 00:43:28,000
Sa'eta we xweş.
 
Health to you.

481
00:43:28,000 --> 00:43:30,000
Were, were Rêber were.
 
Come, come Reber, come.

482
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:33,000
Xolî min dibê 'ere Reşo were'.
 
My uncle says 'come on Resho come'.

483
00:43:33,000 --> 00:43:39,000
Maşallah satil o. Xwedê bereketê têke.
 
Mashallah the bucket. May God put blessing in it.

484
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:41,000
Xoltîk te 'eb heye ne?
 
Auntie, you have fatigue right?

485
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:44,000
'Eb heye lê...
 
There is fatigue but...

486
00:43:44,000 --> 00:43:48,000
'Eb heye lê...
 
There is fatigue but...

487
00:43:48,000 --> 00:43:51,000
We şal dîna bana erdê neçêtir bû?
 
If you had put a shawl on the ground wouldn't it be better?

488
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:58,000
Welah be'al...
 
By God [unclear]...

489
00:43:58,000 --> 00:44:01,000
O Rêber jî diçine ba'îva.
 
Oh, Reber is also picking almonds.

490
00:44:01,000 --> 00:44:03,000
Ere Rêber were biçin.
 
Come on Reber, let's go.

491
00:44:03,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Ere Rêber were biçin.
 
Come on Reber, let's go.

492
00:44:06,000 --> 00:44:12,000
Me'nî eskerê me ba'îva diçinin, em bernadin.
 
Look our soldiers are picking almonds, we don't give up.

493
00:44:12,000 --> 00:44:15,000
Lawkê me jî tim serê kûçik girtiye.
 
Our boy is always holding the dog's head.

494
00:44:15,000 --> 00:44:18,000
A gile, ê pê bigre ho, zincîrê girtiye?
 
Look, hey hold it huh, is the chain holding it?

495
00:44:18,000 --> 00:44:20,000
Toxsê kûçika hez dike.
 
He loves dogs so much.

496
00:44:20,000 --> 00:44:24,000
Ê tê bigre ho.
 
Hey hold it huh.

497
00:44:24,000 --> 00:44:27,000
Maşallah cawîbî gundî pirr xweş e kîbar e.
 
Mashallah the atmosphere of the village is very nice and
elegant.

498
00:44:27,000 --> 00:44:31,000
Sa'eta we xweş, Xwedê pişt û yar û zîvir o.
 
Health to you, may God be your supporter and friend and
return.

499
00:44:31,000 --> 00:44:36,000
Spas.
 
Thanks.

500
00:44:36,000 --> 00:44:40,000
Delîlê we ter hene ke bixwin werin.
 
If you have fresh [almonds] to eat, come.

501
00:44:40,000 --> 00:44:41,000
Erê, cîranî we ne.
 
Yes, they are your neighbors.

502
00:44:41,000 --> 00:44:43,000
Lê cîranî we ne, ne xerîb e.
 
But they are your neighbors, not strangers.

503
00:44:43,000 --> 00:44:46,000
Maşallah xêr bereket pir e, se'dî gundo çûye.
 
Mashallah goodness and blessing is plentiful, the luck of
the village has gone [up].

504
00:44:46,000 --> 00:44:48,000
Werin, werin.
 
Come, come.

505
00:44:48,000 --> 00:44:49,000
Gundê xweş e?
 
Is the village nice?

506
00:44:49,000 --> 00:44:50,000
Xweş e, na xoltîk?
 
It's nice, no auntie?

507
00:44:50,000 --> 00:44:56,000
Maşallah ji gundê Qerugulê ra, xêr û bereket li gundê
Qerugulê pir e.
 
Mashallah for the village of Qerugul, goodness and blessing
in the village of Qerugul is plentiful.

508
00:44:56,000 --> 00:44:59,000
Em hatin xoltîk û xolo va ba'îva diçinin.
 
We came, auntie and uncle are picking almonds here.

509
00:44:59,000 --> 00:45:01,000
Mera tûrek ba'îv jî kirin diyarî.
 
They made a bag of almonds as a gift for us too.

510
00:45:01,000 --> 00:45:03,000
Sa'eta we xweş, Xwedê bereketê têke.
 
Health to you, may God put blessing in it.

511
00:45:03,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Ware cem Xolo jî.
 
Come to Uncle too.

512
00:45:06,000 --> 00:45:08,000
War cem Xolo jî, Xolî min...
 
Come to Uncle too, My uncle...

513
00:45:08,000 --> 00:45:10,000
Folû (Xolo) min dibên çi? Sa'eta we xweş.
 
What does my Uncle say? Health to you.

514
00:45:10,000 --> 00:45:11,000
Sa'eta we xweş.
 
Health to you.

515
00:45:11,000 --> 00:45:13,000
Tiştkî wa heye bibêjin?
 
Is there anything you want to say?

516
00:45:13,000 --> 00:45:17,000
Her tiştekî milet bibîne... û miletê me yê derva...
 
Everything the nation sees... and our nation abroad...

517
00:45:17,000 --> 00:45:22,000
...belkî rûk bi, dilê xwe bi mentiqê bimînin, li me vegerin.
 
...maybe turn their face, keep their heart with the region,
return to us.

518
00:45:22,000 --> 00:45:26,000
Û em bi hevra destk bidin, t'ane nadin çepka.
 
And if we give a hand together, one hand doesn't clap.

519
00:45:26,000 --> 00:45:29,000
Em dixwazin miletê me her yek vegere.
 
We want our nation, everyone to return.

520
00:45:29,000 --> 00:45:31,000
Gundê xwe, cîwarê xwe.
 
To their village, their dwelling.

521
00:45:31,000 --> 00:45:32,000
İnşallah, inşallah.
 
God willing, God willing.

522
00:45:32,000 --> 00:45:33,000
Bimînin.
 
Remain.

523
00:45:33,000 --> 00:45:40,000
Bimînin ha, heta em darin can hevalê me jêr jî, çû ba'îva
diçinin, bimînin.
 
Remain yes, until we go to our friends down there too, who
are picking almonds, remain.

524
00:45:40,000 --> 00:45:46,000
Xwedê 'emrê te dirêj bike. Xêr û bêra Efrîn pir e, mentiqê
Efrîn 366 gund...
 
May God prolong your life. The goodness and bounty of Afrin
is plentiful, Afrin region 366 villages...

525
00:45:46,000 --> 00:45:51,000
Çiqas gundekî çûçik be û av be, her nav maşallah, oxe walo
pir şêrîn e teb'en.
 
However small a village is and water, every name mashallah,
the air is very sweet naturally.

526
00:45:51,000 --> 00:45:55,000
Insanê xurbetê jî... kelem û zinare gunda pê şêrîn e.
 
For the person in exile... the rocks and cliffs of the
village are sweet to him.

527
00:45:55,000 --> 00:45:56,000
Me dîtî ye. Sa'eta we xweş.
 
We have seen it. Health to you.

528
00:45:56,000 --> 00:46:01,000
Emê noka destê we radestî Xwedê kin û emê xatirê xwe ji we
bixwazin.
 
We will now entrust you to God and we will say goodbye to
you.

529
00:46:01,000 --> 00:46:07,000
Yela sehlen.
 
Welcome.

530
00:46:07,000 --> 00:46:11,000
Af (ev) jî pîvazê Xolo ye.
 
This is Uncle's onion patch.

531
00:46:11,000 --> 00:46:14,000
Bacanê reş û xiyar û tiştê wa...
 
Eggplant and cucumber and things like that...

532
00:46:14,000 --> 00:46:18,000
Xolo çandine...
 
Uncle has planted...

533
00:46:18,000 --> 00:46:21,000
Af jî pezê Xolo ye.
 
This is Uncle's sheep.

534
00:46:21,000 --> 00:46:41,000
Berdayî cî xora diçêre.
 
Released grazing for itself.

535
00:46:53,000 --> 00:46:55,000
Erê xoltîk me eniya te jî maç kir.
 
Yes auntie, we kissed your forehead too.

536
00:46:55,000 --> 00:47:00,000
Teb'en Xolo mera baibahî jî kir.
 
Naturally Uncle made [gave] us almonds too.

537
00:47:00,000 --> 00:47:04,000
Pir çê tîne wela weda' pir pîs e çê tîne.
 
It hurts a lot, really farewell is very bad/painful.

538
00:47:04,000 --> 00:47:06,000
Noka emkê ji gund derkevin.
 
Now we will leave the village.

539
00:47:06,000 --> 00:47:10,000
Bîdayê mera dikheve gundekî mera kêfxweş e.
 
At first a village appears to us, we are happy.

540
00:47:10,000 --> 00:47:19,000
Bas çaxê mera ji gund dûr dikeve... çê tîne, weda' pir pîs e
çê tîne.
 
But when it gets far from the village... it hurts, farewell
is very bad/painful.

541
00:47:19,000 --> 00:47:39,000
Emê noka çîçik din xatirê xwe ji gund bixwazin.
 
We will now in a little bit say our goodbyes to the village.

542
00:47:53,000 --> 00:47:59,000
Erê hevalno, dostno û ahbabno, me eniya xoltîkê kir, qîzê
Ebû Şiyar...
 
Yes friends, loved ones, we kissed Auntie's forehead,
[daughter of?] Abu Shiyar...

543
00:47:59,000 --> 00:48:03,000
Çavê gundê maşdikim, Ebû Rêber seheta te jî xweş.
 
I kiss the eyes of the village, Abu Reber health to you too.

544
00:48:03,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Û bavê Sîpan, seheta wî jî xweş.
 
And father of Sîpan, health to him too.

545
00:48:06,000 --> 00:48:09,000
Ev gund e, tebîeta gund e.
 
This is the village, the nature of the village.

546
00:48:09,000 --> 00:48:14,000
Sa'eta we giya xweş. İnşallah me tu teqsîr nekiribine.
 
Health to you all. God willing we haven't been negligent.

547
00:48:14,000 --> 00:48:18,000
Şaşbînê me jî hebin... hûnê qisûrê me pirr ef bikin.
 
If we have mistakes... you will forgive our faults a lot.

548
00:48:18,000 --> 00:48:21,000
Vîdeoyê me jî ke 'efewî ne.
 
Our videos are quite spontaneous.

549
00:48:21,000 --> 00:48:24,000
De inşallah şaşbîn tê nebin.
 
So God willing there are no mistakes in it.

550
00:48:24,000 --> 00:48:26,000
Bi mera bin, vîdyokî din xweş, hejar...
 
Stay with us, another nice video, poor [humble]...

551
00:48:26,000 --> 00:48:30,000
Emê wara xweş bixin nîzîk da inşallah.
 
We will present nice things to you soon God willing.

552
00:48:30,000 --> 00:48:36,000
Her yekî miraz di dil da Xwedê bike. Xwedê dest û ser we
giya ro bigre.
 
Everyone who has a wish in their heart, may God fulfill it.
May God hold everyone's hand and head.

553
00:48:36,000 --> 00:48:38,000
Xwedê rehma xwe li miriyê we giya ke.
 
May God have mercy on all your dead.

554
00:48:38,000 --> 00:48:43,000
Em jî noka ber ve bi Badîno din emê xatirê xwe ji gundê...
Qerugulê... Gundê Qerugulê bi xatirê te.
 
We are now going towards Badina... we will say goodbye to
the village of Qerugul. Village of Qerugul, goodbye.

